# Optional ZeroTier Central flow rules (paste into the network's Flow Rules).
# Only the handheld (ZT address aaaaaaaaaa) and the dev machine (bbbbbbbbbb) may
# reach the robot's TCP 8765; everything else on the network is dropped.
# Replace the 10-digit node IDs. Syntax: ZeroTier rules DSL.
drop
  not ethertype ipv4
  and not ethertype arp
  and not ethertype ipv6
;
accept
  ipprotocol tcp
  and dport 8765
  and (sourceZeroTierAddress aaaaaaaaaa or sourceZeroTierAddress bbbbbbbbbb)
;
drop
  ipprotocol tcp
  and dport 8765
;
accept;
